{"id":2812,"title":{"romaji":"Taboo Tattoo","english":null,"native":null},"slug":"taboo_tattoo","synopsis":"The manga which this will be based off follows Justice Akazuka (nickname Seigi), a young man who is good at martial arts. Seigi rescues a homeless old man on the street one day from some thugs, and the man gives Seigi an object that imprints a tattoo on his palm. However, it is not an ordinary tattoo, but a special weapon that gives Seigi supernatural powers such as warping space-time. Seigi then meets a female American agent named Ijii, whose duty is to recover the tattoos. Seigi decides to help her and gets wrapped up in a cross-national conspiracy.\n\n\n(Source: Anime News Network)","format":"TV","season":"SUMMER","year":2016,"createdAt":"2021-03-27 00:44:40","updatedAt":"2021-03-28 08:25:26","resources":{"nodes":[{"site":"MAL","externalId":29758},{"site":"ANILIST","externalId":21031},{"site":"KITSU","externalId":10344},{"site":"ANIDB","externalId":11039},{"site":"ANN","externalId":17122},{"site":"ANIME_PLANET","externalId":6928},{"site":"OFFICIAL_SITE","externalId":null},{"site":"X","externalId":null},{"site":"CRUNCHYROLL","externalId":null}]},"images":{"nodes":[{"id":5609,"facet":"LARGE_COVER","path":"anime/large-cover/tmjcthuwVD1Z1FFGKEgmlHbiBEatC7t0ORHOse2K.jpg"},{"id":5610,"facet":"SMALL_COVER","path":"anime/small-cover/PHI8F32CNidNpBfXhYuwpwKIIHJkr5V1iNnPXp1h.avif"}]},"studios":{"nodes":[{"id":34,"name":"J.C.Staff","slug":"jcstaff"}]},"series":{"nodes":[]},"animethemes":[{"id":6914,"slug":"OP1","type":"OP","sequence":null,"song":{"id":6914,"title":{"romaji":"Belief","native":null}},"animethemeentries":[{"id":8032,"version":1,"episodes":"1-11","nsfw":false,"spoiler":false,"videos":{"nodes":[{"id":7286,"basename":"TabooTattoo-OP1-NCBD1080.webm","filename":"TabooTattoo-OP1-NCBD1080","link":"https://v.animethemes.moe/TabooTattoo-OP1-NCBD1080.webm","mimetype":"video/webm","size":43417649,"resolution":1080,"nc":true,"subbed":false,"lyrics":false,"overlap":"